  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "She shouts the name as two traces of yellow sand gush from her ears. The sand gathers and envelops her entire body. In a few breaths she has turned into a sand giant about the size of Fang Yuan’s six meter heavenly zombie body, but thicker. The sand giant slams with both arms. Its fists scatter into yellow sand on impact, then the sand merges and the fists form again. Fang Yuan’s fists fracture in the clash, then recover as he keeps striking.",
      "chapters": [
        674
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She normally relies on its thick defense to make relentless assaults and bully other Gu Immortals. Fang Yuan coils eight arms around her, destroys the sand giant’s two arms, slams its head apart with his knee, and chops with his right leg like a battle axe. The yellow sand scatters, the defensive killer move breaks, and she vomits blood. She judges Fang Yuan’s Hair Armor stronger than martial sand armor.",
      "chapters": [
        675
      ],
